{
  "date": "2026-11-15",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "吴清：A股总市值已经超过100万亿元",
  "title_en": "Wu Qing: the total market value of A-shares has passed 100 trillion yuan",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月14日，一个关于中国资本市场的学术年会在上海开幕。证监会是管理中国证券市场的政府部门，它的主席吴清在会上讲话。他说，现在A股的总市值已经超过100万亿元。",
      "en": "On November 14, an academic annual conference on China's capital market opened in Shanghai. The CSRC is the government department that manages China's securities market, and its chairman, Wu Qing, spoke at the conference. He said that the total market value of A-shares has now passed 100 trillion yuan."
    },
    {
      "zh": "吴清还介绍了其他一些数字。中国债券市场的规模超过210万亿元。从2024年到现在，社保基金、保险资金和养老金一共净买入了1.5万亿元以上的A股。",
      "en": "Wu Qing also gave some other figures. The size of China's bond market is more than 210 trillion yuan. From 2024 until now, social security funds, insurance money and pension funds have made net purchases of more than 1.5 trillion yuan of A-shares in total."
    },
    {
      "zh": "今年前9个月，企业通过股票和债券获得的直接融资，差不多占社会融资规模增加部分的一半。现在A股有5500多家上市公司，股民超过2亿人。",
      "en": "In the first nine months of this year, direct financing that companies got through stocks and bonds made up almost half of the increase in total social financing. A-shares now have more than 5,500 listed companies, and more than 200 million individual stock investors."
    },
    {
      "zh": "吴清提出，下一步要在六个方面“进一步深化”研究，其中包括市场怎样保持长期稳定、人工智能和资本市场的关系，以及资本市场怎样参与全球金融治理。",
      "en": "Wu Qing proposed that, as a next step, research should be \"further deepened\" in six areas, including how the market can stay stable over the long term, the relationship between artificial intelligence and the capital market, and how the capital market can take part in global financial governance."
    }
  ],
